description:
Change under review: add an archive export endpoint for the internal dashboard. Added files are shown in full. For changed files, only the changed region is shown; the rest of the file, including the `app` router setup and the import of `createArchive`, is unchanged and compiles.

`src/routes/export.ts` (changed, lines 14-18):
```ts
14 app.get("/export", async (req) => {
15   const name = new URL(req.url).searchParams.get("name") ?? "export";
16   const archive = await createArchive(name);
17   return new Response(Bun.file(archive));
18 });
```

`src/lib/archive.ts` (added):
```ts
1 export async function createArchive(name: string): Promise<string> {
2   const target = `/var/exports/${name}.tgz`;
3   const proc = Bun.spawn(["sh", "-c", `tar -czf ${target} /srv/data`]);
4   await proc.exited;
5   return target;
6 }
```

The route is mounted on the same server as the public API.
